# generated scan data — all of it is local user data, including the built markdown.
# Anchored with a leading slash: these are directories of the *root* (which defaults to
# the project directory), and an unanchored `export/` also matched the `ocrmd/export/`
# package, which is how that package went missing from the repository for two releases.
/raw/
/processed/
/ocr/
/llm/
/documents/
/etl/
/layout/
/export/
/reconstructed/
